From: Your Name <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:42:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] feat: integrate SMAC Gaussian Process surrogate and
 acquisition loop

Add optimizer.SMACSurrogate, the cheap model that screens candidates.

- Gaussian Process regression via fitrgp (Matern 5/2, constant basis)
  on inputs scaled to the unit hypercube
- Expected Improvement and Lower Confidence Bound acquisition functions
  (EI written with erfc, no extra toolbox calls)
- screen() ranks candidate wolf positions by acquisition score and
  returns predictive mean/sigma for every candidate
- validationRMSE() measures out-of-sample error before new data is added
- Bounded training window that keeps elite plus recent observations
- Tests on EI/LCB maths, GP accuracy, ranking, windowing and the
  NetworkEnv problem
---
